OL,5,G1400 Record Review
OL,6,     FAndrew McGregor with a thorough
OL,7,     Flook at the week's classical music
OL,8,     Freleases, plus news and
OL,9,     Frecommendations.
OL,10,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,11,     FEdith Bowman presents your weekly
OL,12,     Ffilm music mix. This week,
OL,13,     Fcomposer Natalie Holt joins to
OL,14,     Fexplore her score to the new Shaun
OL,15,     Fthe Sheep movie, released last
OL,16,     Fmonth.
OL,17,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,18,     FJess Gillam is joined by British
OL,19,     Fcomposer Tom Coult, for a
OL,20,     Flistening party, including music
OL,21,     Fby Henry Purcell, Igor Stravinsky,
OL,22,     Fand Tom Waits.
